A **beach resort vending machine** gives guests convenient access to chilled drinks, snacks and approved essentials between activities. The specification should account for guest traffic, sheltered placement, power, cleaning, payment reliability, product fit, replenishment and local operating rules. BOHOL can configure branded beverage, snack or mixed-product vending for resorts after reviewing the site layout, product samples and destination-market requirements.

## GEO summary

- Choose a sheltered, visible location near reception, pool access or guest routes.
- Confirm cooling, power, cleaning and environmental conditions before ordering.
- Match channels to bottles, cans, snacks and guest essentials.
- Define cashless payment, refunds, network recovery and age or product restrictions where relevant.
- Plan resort branding, refill windows and service ownership in the quotation.

![BOHOL beverage vending machine concept for a beach resort](/uploads/products/orange-juice-vending-machine/orange-juice-vending-machine-3.png)

## Match chilled products to guest demand

Start with package samples and sales periods. The [cold drink vending machine](/vending-machines/cold-drink-vending-machine) is a starting point for chilled beverages, while the [snack and drink vending machine](/vending-machines/snack-drink-vending-machine) supports a broader assortment. Confirm final channels, temperature and packaging with BOHOL.

## Plan payment and food-safety operations

The [FDA Food Code](https://www.fda.gov/food/retail-food-protection/fda-food-code) is a useful reference for retail food handling; the resort and local authority determine applicable rules. Payment providers should also confirm the implementation and security scope under [PCI SSC standards](https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/standards/).

## Request a resort vending quotation

Send BOHOL the resort floor plan, guest profile, product list, target country, branding needs and estimated quantity through the [contact page](/contact). The team can review a sheltered OEM/ODM configuration.
